      "textOverrides": {
        "frame.name": "Arctic Zephyr",
        "bg.hand-size": "11",
        "content.notes": "- group: \n  - custom: \"%p_font-size:6em;color:#554e65%%rimearc%%p%\"\n    position: absolute\n    top: 5.2px\n    left: 43.5px\n  - custom: \"%p_font-size:5.6em%%persist-circle-start%%p%\"\n  - exampleText: Held\n    fontSize: 35px\n    position: relative\n    top: -20px\n    left: 78px\n  flexDirection: column\n  position: absolute\n  left: -20px\n  top: 15px\n- custom: \"You wield a gigantic ice blade called the %p_color:#72d3ee%Rimearc%p% %p_left:1px;top:-1px%%rimearc%%p% that you fling across the battlefield. The %p_left:1px;top:-1px%%rimearc%%p% is a token that can enter any hex, but cannot move through wall lines. At the start of each scenario, %p_left:1px;top:-1px%%rimearc%%p%  starts %p_color:#0dccf2%held%p% on your character mat, and while %p_color:#0dccf2%held%p% it is considered to be in the hex you occupy. The hex with the %p_left:1px;top:-1px%%rimearc%%p% is not considered negative.\" \n  width: 725px\n  position: relative\n  left: 230px\n  marginLeft: 10px\n  marginBottom: 15px\n- divider: \n- custom: \"You have special %p_left:1px;top:-1px%%rimearc%%p% abilities; %p_color:#dc72ed%Throw%p% %p_left:-2px;top:-1px%%ithrow%%p% and %p_color:#edb072%Recall%p% %p_left:-1px;top:-2px%%irecall%%p%. While the %p_left:1px;top:-1px%%rimearc%%p% is %p_color:#0dccf2%held%p%, you may use %p_left:-2px;top:-1px%%ithrow%%p%X abilities to %push%X targeting the %p_left:1px;top:-1px%%rimearc%%p%. Otherwise, you may use %p_left:-1px;top:-2px%%irecall%%p%X abilities to %pull%X targeting the %rimearc%. %p_background-color:#E0A0402E%You may perform a %p_left:-1px;top:-2px%%irecall%%p%X ability %i%only%ie% if the %p_left:1px;top:-1px%%rimearc%%p% ends in your hex%p%. After each of your abilities, if the %p_left:1px;top:-1px%%rimearc%%p% is in the hex you occupy, it becomes %p_color:#0dccf2%held%p%. %p_left:1px;top:-1px%%rimearc%%p% abilities do not follow normal targeting rules. Instead, they target figures in hexes the %p_left:1px;top:-1px%%rimearc%%p% entered or exited during the associated %p_left:-2px;top:-1px%%ithrow%%p% or %p_left:0px;top:-2px%%irecall%%p% ability after the movement of %p_left:1px;top:-1px%%rimearc%%p% was resolved.\"\n  marginTop: -5px",
        "content.resource-tracker.name": "(Held)"
