      "classDescription": "The Arctic Zephyrs exist within both tribes. Smaller than their kin, they master the mountain gales and cold through rigorous training. They ignore internal feuds to protect against external threats, serving as elite guardians. In battle, they conjure and guide massive ice blades called Rimearcs. The freezing gales generated by these flying blades earned them their name.",
